data: {"type":"response.completed","sequence_number":736,"response":{"id":"resp_0bfe6e1fa8f24ccf016adb3d079d7c81919e66672231e17d83","object":"response","created_at":1792752903,"completed_at":1792752911,"status":"completed","background":false,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"presence_penalty":0.0,"moderation":null,"model":"gpt-6-luna","access_programs":null,"previous_response_id":null,"instructions":"Complete the supplied mathematical task using only its explicit inputs and tools. Submit the requested JSON artifact through submit_artifact. Tool feedback is real task feedback; do not invent a successful check. This is a Yui workflow stage. Read the relevant declared Yui rules, preserve the supplied proof route and exact allowed assumptions, and distinguish mathematical review from structural checks.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_0bfe6e1fa8f24ccf016adb3d0876188191a521c40e3a476555","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABq2z0Iw8vZcWEjiY4VNDKOg_w7v3jCNBb_C9WEMOvYulD8Zdf3oA7fBXMk7amQnVWibElfldRNJnHeKbFV4pODwsYWDAFVf_GjCj7tGy9y6y2_kauN-U8EMJ8uMldZM0PP1Njm_5R_8SgT6XDRn5WBanJ0A1dHnkwyVaAMxtS7YjTEdiloXZDk2N37vdY78wBqe9ZX2nuPu6HsavhDGNMa9u2s6EIiqI1TLnHJKDDvkVVuL451iPmHgeW40gQv7RbkC26yuJ8ZGGNabmnVPdLYAAkgz7llU0XJJu6xUMZ-RFwhNjQvUAc-2pPi14mtd4Y0wPdxSnexeStTgajTw7UeE3N9lGmIkPxYXXQzkF5z4_v8H9HuXtVc5usTzDV99y1w9HhFzGgR0QTHo6p9k2Nbn8iMNEKpr7lRI-_ZW-C4hX3HiEh8ij-ux_5K7Tgn0fwM6CKd1AzRjnPHT7P0mFMhwXXZrt5iOV2vveiGLr6zRLo-Ii2TgLtQtR-upO9bdEL2TFniLBMeTBJZpb0ZD815Rxy-0LHcTPh5gHm5L05X6nYPB45MDlY809N5HYs123yx5HtIajhbsCnZp117Qg1yIfzJ_BDIgyYCZJRtO-NYFQhgrsoySwmkQTUurx_W_GmA8mJKSE27sMBBBzkQPvn3NrpTSrUPu6xYKM_rBZlLwIrvndqs250y860M0D4zfVEgcWRINyp4asArUMROke3v58WrheXNANAiDQP9mjsK7ME-fDSY2AQxubHspaE0zvPZns0u6fuHdqpvfVJlLMdNVAxiovRHiUAqhlfN6FxbqTMBmLdfsAIIpNGMDHOlt6ZrtKaZExdARvDR8UASAF0Y0L_0cLOMrReUriBGnSsdQSpX5layC8cT-VcreAOXuUDcDZ6zR-GrSgRoRCCojDVaL3rIWfk2SnlxzDChpTmfZjhd7fksHVeyfFkcWY8w1nQEpnWtldBPe_mF3J9WowblAh6Kw20xf0on5arxs_1G3h4gOb6WopHUpHv9bcx4QMTB2q5NTfVp2hLV1v7h1q3zpoXiCVgnID8p-kVNyLOwF_uOQuRU97WQOM-s262RDl54Z9FFssC28BtKkE0ugljt7d2sO4BcecQ4rPp0mobueZEG3dSWfMz2Nt4-_NhgCV0J_Yt1iRmWZUPC-wymbi2zFIDuicKtL9K4_bZDn61Y9lDlnD0aRpfdxWIjeGiUadXq9_VIpJm1PAX8PW7eUaNHSzm-C-llgcqMhsLBpLs_qUiyNKVTjR5U81G59ATdprDdDm7UtHw2Djvv7f5gFZYFsM1mv67pYBzrJfl66A8GfiQSP_9qAzRNssMqdpytUO7jU5smQgKJ_nuzeHITHtmd9XiFBNQWh7mWirQTJ2FTKlypU3uGkAsTvfxl7yuuok22Em3jZ4nLNiQoBh_6hOwotstLU-TibFNxjppc6k81XnbPO6Iutc0mBdik7Gs2zT5QraSYaeHzVDNaqc0AJBLrpcBNdeBSyhHNxoeUyfykDV4RKfCZwpaV6voeYuP64f5lV-S-kaewccy39DUsFsngWP_QjSuHUdWQSuwnMFrcfsWHzcYtTGiFK7EnKOqvFrDKcqssPWol2Jl8_emD0QD3Qcb7GpaBWL9npD0pE4-AjgZTCC4="},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_0bfe6e1fa8f24ccf016adb3d0896488191a1236f0ef638f727","call_id":"call_842b5e31065246e397264850e35400b2","name":"check_artifact","arguments":"{\"artifact_json\":\"{\\\"base_candidate\\\":26,\\\"patches\\\":[{\\\"op\\\":\\\"add\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/graph/propositions/-\\\",\\\"value\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"M010\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"mathlib\\\",\\\"statement\\\":\\\"For finite index types ι and ι′ related by an equivalence, and coordinatewise volume measures on finite-dimensional real Pi spaces, reindexing coordinates by the equivalence preserves volume.\\\",\\\"definitions\\\":[],\\\"binders\\\":[{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"ι\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"finite type\\\"},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"ι′\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"finite type\\\"},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"α\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"ι→Type\\\"},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"f\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"equivalence ι′≃ι\\\"}],\\\"objects\\\":[\\\"ι\\\",\\\"ι′\\\",\\\"α\\\",\\\"f\\\"],\\\"source\\\":{\\\"declaration\\\":\\\"MeasureTheory.volume_measurePreserving_piCongrLeft\\\",\\\"module\\\":\\\"Mathlib.MeasureTheory.Constructions.Pi\\\",\\\"hypotheses\\\":[\\\"ι and ι′ are finite.\\\",\\\"f is an equivalence between the index types.\\\",\\\"Each coordinate carries its volume measure and the coordinate volume measures are sigma-finite.\\\"]}}},{\\\"op\\\":\\\"replace\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/graph/inferences/4/inputs\\\",\\\"value\\\":[\\\"N002\\\",\\\"M001\\\",\\\"M003\\\",\\\"M007\\\",\\\"M010\\\"]},{\\\"op\\\":\\\"replace\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/graph/inferences/4/argument/0/uses\\\",\\\"value\\\":[\\\"N002\\\",\\\"M001\\\",\\\"M003\\\",\\\"M007\\\",\\\"M010\\\"]},{\\\"op\\\":\\\"replace\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/graph/inferences/4/argument/0/text\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"At time r set g_j=u_t·u_{x_j}. Smoothness and compact support give continuous compactly supported derivatives, so they are integrable by M001. For each j, reindex the finite Pi-coordinate family ℝ^n by the bijection separating coordinate j from the other n−1 coordinates; M010 states that this coordinate reindexing preserves volume. Thus the spatial measure is the product of Lebesgue measure on the remaining coordinates and on the jth coordinate. On each coordinate line integrate by parts with M007, taking v=1; the boundary values of g_j vanish, so the line integral of ∂_j g_j is zero. M003 applies to the product-integrable reindexed derivative and identifies its whole-space integral with the iterated line integral, giving ∫∂_j g_j=0. Expanding the product derivative yields ∫u_{x_j}·∂_j u_t=−∫u_t·u_{x_jx_j}. Summing over j and differentiating the finite Frobenius energy sum gives ∫e_t=2∫u_t·(u_{tt}−Δ_xu). The already established identity E′(r)=∫e_t(x,r)dx therefore gives E′(r)=2∫u_t·(u_{tt}−Δ_xu).\\\"},{\\\"op\\\":\\\"add\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/graph/inferences/4/applications/-\\\",\\\"value\\\":{\\\"input\\\":\\\"M010\\\",\\\"at\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"bindings\\\":\\\"ι=Fin n, ι′=Fin(n−1)⊕Fin 1, f the equivalence separating coordinate j; every coordinate space is ℝ with Lebesgue volume.\\\",\\\"hypothesis_checks\\\":[\\\"The coordinate index types are finite because n is a natural number.\\\",\\\"The split/reordering of coordinate labels is an equivalence.\\\",\\\"Each factor is ℝ with its volume measure, which is sigma-finite.\\\"]}}]}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_artifact","description":"Check a JSON artifact against the explicit stage contract; this is not automatic mathematical certification.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_artifact","description":"Submit a JSON artifact after its stage checks.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"report_obstacle","description":"Report exact status, location, explanation, basis, partial_progress. SUBSTANTIVE_GAP or SUSPECTED_GAP stops for an actual unsupported mathematical implication; give its premises, conclusion and mathematical grounds. SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE or INPUT_CONFLICT stops for a real source-access/original-input obstacle. Ordinary unfinished drafting, source registration or format work must use TASK_INCOMPLETE: this records progress without ending the stage; continue the actual work. Difficulty or artifact incompletion alone is not a mathematical gap.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"obstacle_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["obstacle_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"probe_library","description":"Query a proved Mathlib theorem and its exact signature/axioms in the offline sandbox. Returns located evidence for an M source; the mathematical statement and applicability still require review.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"declaration":{"type":"string"},"module":{"type":"string"}},"required":["id","declaration","module"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_draft","description":"Read a JSON pointer in your own same-stage candidate after an actual structural check. No other file/stage is accessible; choose a narrow pointer for large objects.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"candidate":{"type":"integer"},"pointer":{"type":"string"}},"required":["candidate","pointer"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false}],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":false,"prompt_cache_key":"6d76c05d-3341-4fd6-a800-445494f0ad3e","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"low"},"top_p":0.98,"top_logprobs":0,"temperature":1.0,"reasoning":{"effort":"high","context":"all_turns","summary":null,"mode":"standard"},"user":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":100506,"input_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":70400,"cache_write_tokens":0},"output_tokens":770,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":11},"total_tokens":101276,"attribution":{"items":{"fc_0bfe6e1fa8f24ccf016adb3b0a8810819191ac5c11c35bea1b":{"input_tokens":31,"cached_tokens":31,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0bfe6e1fa8f24ccf016adb3b0d27a481919451a73dfa444f2a":{"input_tokens":34,"cached_tokens":34,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0bfe6e1fa8f24ccf016adb3b0fb93c81918735bc34b03fe930":{"input_tokens":34,"cached_tokens":34,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0bfe6e1fa8f24ccf016adb3b1249f88191977b74b605e5a15e":{"input_tokens":33,"cached_tokens":33,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0bfe6e1fa8f24ccf016adb3b148e608191911643d76a27bdd9":{"input_tokens":35,"cached_tokens":35,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0bfe6e1fa8f24ccf016adb3b17216c81919e047bbff18f0a1d":{"input_tokens":34,"cached_tokens":34,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0bfe6e1fa8f24ccf016adb3b195efc819191a3b2ccbed53434":{"input_tokens":33,"cached_tokens":33,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0bfe6e1fa8f24ccf016adb3b1be9d081918c97cb9e333fbb19":{"input_tokens":31,"cached_tokens":31,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0bfe6e1fa8f24ccf016adb3b1e8ed48191ad8e89e0a0bc05b2":{"input_tokens":32,"cached_tokens":32,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0bfe6e1fa8f24ccf016adb3b20f9288191aafd3a11925ae4f7":{"input_tokens":32,"cached_tokens":32,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0bfe6e1fa8f24ccf016adb3b242c1c8191b4f5ad297d6f906c":{"input_tokens":32,"cached_tokens":32,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0bfe6e1fa8f24ccf016adb3b26b3f48191bf918d79cc9a5813":{"input_tokens":32,"cached_tokens":32,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0bfe6e1fa8f24ccf016adb3b29349c8191862ba2696f3e9467":{"input_tokens":32,"cached_tokens":32,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0bfe6e1fa8f24ccf016adb3b2b34448191b7598941acb90f2c":{"input_tokens":33,"cach